      <div class="dp-callout dp-info">
        <span class="dp-ci">ℹ</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Governance model:</strong> The supervisor operates within a fixed authority
          envelope. Supervisor approval (Step 1) advances a claim to
          <code>compliance_cleared</code>. The corridor protocol verification (Step 2) runs
          automatically and may require Governor-level liquidity injection if headroom is
          insufficient. The Governor's Desk is the only interface that can inject liquidity
          to unblock a <code>insufficient_corridor_liquidity</code> claim.
        </div>
      </div>
