          <tr><td><strong>EarmarkReleased</strong></td><td>Cancel or reject of a ready_to_mint claim</td><td>claim_id, corridor_id, released_amount, released_at</td><td>Corridor ops ledger, audit log</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>SupervisorRejected</strong></td><td>POST /reject succeeds</td><td>claim_id, supervisor_id, decision_notes, rejected_at</td><td>Audit log, originator notification</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>ClarificationRequested</strong></td><td>POST /request_clarification</td><td>claim_id, supervisor_id, notes</td><td>Originator notification, audit log</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>SupervisorLockExpired</strong></td><td>10 minute inactivity on locked claim</td><td>claim_id, original_supervisor_id, expired_at</td><td>Lock service, supervisor desk queue</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div>

    <!-- §10 End-to-End Flow -->
    <div class="dp-section" id="flow">
      <div class="dp-section-header">
        <div class="dp-section-num">§10</div>
        <h2>End-to-End Workflow</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Complete walkthrough: supervisor reviews and approves the NGA→GHA claim from the Trade Claim flow example — both the successful path (ready_to_mint) and the liquidity-blocked path.</p>

      <h3>Path A — Successful Approval (ready_to_mint)</h3>
      <div class="dp-flow">
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Open Supervisor Desk</h4><p>Supervisor navigates to sandbox dashboard. Clicks "Supervisor Approval Desk". Modal opens with backdrop blur. <code>loadSupervisorClaims()</code> fires → <code>GET /api/v2/trade_claims</code>. Pending queue populates with 1 claim: TC-20260519142233.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Review claim in queue</h4><p>Queue row shows: Claim ID: TC-20260519142233, Institution: Access Bank Ghana, Amount: 500,000 GHS, Corridor: NGA-GHA, Status: pending_review (grey), Submitted: 2m ago.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Select claim</h4><p>Supervisor clicks the row. <code>selectSupervisorClaim("1")</code> fires. <code>String(c.id) === String(claimId)</code> resolves correctly. Detail panel populates with full claim data. Five-gate matrix shows all gates pending — supervisor_approval gate not yet passed.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Review five gates</h4><p>Supervisor reviews gate display: compliance pre_cleared ✓, corridor limits within bounds ✓, liquidity position adequate ✓ (live headroom displayed), no governance blocks ✓. Only supervisor_approval pending.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Add decision notes (optional)</h4><p>Supervisor types: "Standard import claim. Corridor NGA-GHA in good standing. Pre-cleared compliance." in decision notes field.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Approve — Step 1</h4><p>Supervisor clicks Approve. Button disables. <code>POST /api/v2/trade_claims/1/approve {notes: "..."}</code>. Server sets status: compliance_cleared, writes compliance_cleared_at.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Approve — Step 2 (automatic)</h4><p>CorridorVerificationService runs immediately. Reads NGA-GHA corridor: domestic_available 5,000,000 NGN, linked_outstanding 1,200,000 NGN, existing earmarks 0. free_headroom = 3,800,000 NGN. claim_amount 500,000 GHS equivalent within headroom. Earmark written: earmarks[corridor_id] += 500,000.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step" style="border-left-color:#10b981;"><h4>Outcome: ready_to_mint</h4><p>Server returns status: ready_to_mint, issuance_eligible: true, all 5 gates passed. Green result modal: "Trade claim TC-20260519142233 — READY TO MINT. bearerCORE issuance authorised." Status badge → Ready to Mint (green). Action buttons disable. Queue refreshes.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Settlement trigger</h4><p>CorridorProtocolVerified event emitted. Settlement service notified. bearerCORE minting authorised against corridor NGA-GHA. Full audit record finalised with corridor headroom snapshot and earmark confirmation.</p></div>
      </div>

      <h3>Path B — Liquidity Blocked (insufficient_corridor_liquidity → Governor → re_evaluate)</h3>
      <div class="dp-flow">
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Approve (steps 1–2 same as Path A)</h4><p>Supervisor approves. CorridorVerificationService finds free_headroom = 200,000 GHS equivalent. Claim amount is 500,000 GHS. Headroom insufficient.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step" style="border-left-color:#f59e0b;"><h4>Outcome: insufficient_corridor_liquidity</h4><p>Server returns status: insufficient_corridor_liquidity. Amber result modal: "⚠ Corridor NGA-GHA headroom insufficient. Required: 500,000 GHS. Available: 200,000 GHS. Governor liquidity injection required before settlement can proceed." Re-Evaluate button activates.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Governor injects liquidity</h4><p>Governor's Desk operator injects 400,000 GHS into corridor NGA-GHA via allocation. After HANDSHAKE_WINDOW (7s), the allocation is treated as confirmed by CorridorVerificationService.live_liquidity().</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step"><h4>Re-Evaluate</h4><p>Supervisor clicks Re-Evaluate. <code>POST /api/v2/trade_claims/1/re_evaluate</code>. CorridorVerificationService re-runs: new free_headroom = 600,000 GHS equivalent. 500,000 claim amount now fits. Earmark written.</p></div>
        <div class="dp-step" style="border-left-color:#10b981;"><h4>Outcome: ready_to_mint</h4><p>Status advances to ready_to_mint. UI updates. bearerCORE issuance authorised. EligibilityReevaluated event emitted with updated gate snapshot.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="dp-callout dp-ok">
        <span class="dp-ci">✓</span>
        <div>End state (both paths): Claim TC-20260519142233 in status <code>ready_to_mint</code>. All five gates passed. Supervisor identity, decision notes, compliance_cleared_at, verification_note, and gate snapshot immutably recorded. Corridor NGA-GHA headroom reduced by earmarked amount. bearerCORE minting authorised.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

